            "review_title": "Review at Pho Ong Ca",
            "review_text": "GourmetBaladeur\nHCMC175 contributions\n0\nAverage pho, but australian quality beef\nFeb 2017\nAttracted by crowded clients, we decided to try this restaurant, specialized in tail beef pho. They posted on the making of their pho, insisting on the cleanliness and the australian beef quality.\nNothing special, just average pho for Saigon.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 3, 2017",
